Lead Accountant, France & Accounting Integration &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;Meet the Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;At Fever, our &lt;strong&gt;Accounting team&lt;/strong&gt; keeps finances accurate, compliant, and transparent. We define &lt;strong&gt;financial parameters&lt;/strong&gt;, resolve &lt;strong&gt;compliance issues&lt;/strong&gt;, and develop &lt;strong&gt;better tools&lt;/strong&gt; to manage and report data. Partnering with teams like &lt;strong&gt;Legal&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Operations&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Brand Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;, we ensure every project is accounted for and every number tells the right story.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us&lt;/strong&gt; if you want to &lt;strong&gt;ensure financial excellence&lt;/strong&gt;, use&lt;strong&gt;innovative reporting tools&lt;/strong&gt;, and provide the &lt;strong&gt;transparent insights&lt;/strong&gt; that support our &lt;strong&gt;rapid global growth&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;France operations: &lt;/strong&gt;lead the accounting of our French ticketing entity, including the monthly, quarterly, and annual close, sub-ledger and cash reviews, and the supervision of team members, working closely with CFO of French ticketing entity to maintain high standards across the team-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing and reporting: &lt;/strong&gt;deliver the Group reporting package on time, prepare the statutory accounts under French GAAP and reconcile them with Group IFRS reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit: &lt;/strong&gt;act as main point of contact for statutory auditors (CAC) and Group auditors, preparing audit files and answering requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tax and compliance coordination: &lt;/strong&gt;be the main point of contact with external advisors, providing reliable data and reviewing their outputs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Management reporting support: &lt;/strong&gt;provide analysis to management, ensuring consistency between the ledger and the management accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;M&amp;amp;A accounting: &lt;/strong&gt;execute acquisition analysis, map acquired entities&#39; charts of accounts to Group standards, validate data migrations and coordinate Day-1 readiness and the first unified close.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playbook and processes: &lt;/strong&gt;build and maintain our Integration playbook and strengthen internal controls across the entities you work on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Book-keeping&amp;nbsp;of monthly transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reporting and controlling of entities&amp;nbsp;expenses reviewing its correct coding within the accounting records&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reconciliation of monthly revenues and reconciliation with payment processors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Approve large financial transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Contribute to&amp;nbsp;financial audit processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Participate in and support various projects and continuous improvement efforts across the Accounting function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Manage relationships with&amp;nbsp;external accounting service providers&amp;nbsp;to make the accounting function as accurate and agile as possible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Master&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance or a related field. DSCG / DEC (or equivalent) is valuable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;5–7 years of experience, including at least 3 years in a Big Four firm (audit or transaction services). Hands-on experience with French statutory closings and audits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical skills: &lt;/strong&gt;strong command of French GAAP and IFRS, including business combinations and purchase price allocation; experience with chart of accounts mapping and group reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;native or bilingual French and professional English; Spanish is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;experience leading or coordinating a team, and comfortable working with external advisors and auditors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech stack: &lt;/strong&gt;advanced Excel; experience with ERP migrations; knowledge of Business Central / Navision is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft skills: &lt;/strong&gt;strong ownership, meticulous, able to seamlessly balance operational priorities with tight project deadlines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of French tax (VAT, corporate income tax, CFE/CVAE, liasse fiscale) to steer tax advisors with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;FP&amp;amp;A literacy: budget vs. actual analysis, management reporting and cash flow forecasting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in M&amp;amp;A transactions, due diligence, or post-merger integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Background in ticketing, marketplaces or payments on behalf of third parties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Love It Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Attractive compensation package to reward your contributions and growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;40% discount on all Fever events and experiences + free Candlelight voucher.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible remuneration with Cobee: meals, transport, training, and nursery support (tax-exempt).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Payflow: option to access part of your salary in advance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Taxdown: help optimizing and filing your taxes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Private health &amp;amp; dental insurance with Cigna: 100% covered by Fever. You can also add your family members via flexible remuneration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Wellhub membership for gym and wellness access: 100% covered by Fever up to the Silver plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Language learning support: English and Spanish lessons.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Hybrid work setup: home office friendly with a central Madrid office location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Snacks, drinks, and fresh fruit are always available at the office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Dynamic international team: a young, talented group creating a great work environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun  BCX0 SCXO235629371&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun  BCX0 SCXO235629371&quot;&gt;#LI-hybrid #LI-fulltime&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more about us: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-US/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-UKI/208389-goldman-sachs-asset-management-leads-227m-investment-in-live-entertainment-tech-startup-fever&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fever&#39;s Blog&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.eu/2023/02/02/fever-raises-110-million-in-new-round-at-1-8-billion-valuation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech.Eu&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fever is committed to creating an inclusive and diverse workspace where everyone&#39;s background and ideas count. Our main goal is to find the best possible talent regardless of place of birth, racial or ethnic origin, gender, gender identity, religion, opinion, sexual orientation, disability, pregnancy, marital status, age or caring responsibilities. We encourage everyone to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require any kind of accommodation during the selection process please contact our Talent team so we can help you by providing a welcoming and seamless journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to know more about how Fever processes your personal data, click here&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cIzPP7QJGht5LAGKkRGQP8fxh-Z4Mfph2JhGSvhd8zM/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.y7rpsj7nzave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fever - Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Finance

Staff Software Engineer &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now is an amazing time to join Nozomi Networks as we build the future of OT and IoT cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We defend some of the world’s largest organizations and critical infrastructure in more than 68 countries and we’re just getting started. Our AI-powered cybersecurity platform secures operational technology (OT) and Internet of Things (IoT) infrastructures for enterprises and government entities across energy, manufacturing, transportation, resources, and critical infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Staff Software Engineer to join our engineering organization and play a key role in shaping the&amp;nbsp;architecture, scalability, and long-term evolution of our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As a Staff Engineer at Nozomi Networks, you will operate at both a technical leadership and hands-on engineering level, driving complex initiatives across teams while setting a high bar for engineering excellence.&amp;nbsp;You will own critical areas of the system, influence architectural decisions, and mentor engineers, while delivering impactful&amp;nbsp;features and platform improvements at scale.&lt;br&gt;The final job title (e.g., Software Engineer, Senior, or Staff) will be aligned to the successful candidate&#39;s demonstrated level of knowledge, skills, and impact, rather than years of experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You could be the next &quot;Nozomier&quot;! If this sounds like you, read on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In this role you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Lead the design and evolution of distributed systems that power our OT/IoT cybersecurity platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Drive architecture decisions with a long-term perspective on scalability, performance, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Own cross-team initiatives, aligning engineering efforts with product and business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Identify and systematically reduce technical debt, improving system reliability and developer productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Act as a technical multiplier, mentoring engineers and raising the bar on design, code quality, and operational&amp;nbsp;excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Define and champion best practices in software design, testing, and observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, SRE, and Security teams to deliver end-to-end solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Influence and improve engineering processes, ensuring effective delivery in a fast-paced agile environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Take ownership of mission-critical features and services, from concept through production and beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Embody Nozomi Networks’ cultural pillars, promoting transparency, trust, and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;To be successful in this opportunity, you will have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Extensive experience designing and building large-scale distributed systems in production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in at least one core language: Golang, C++, or Ruby&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with JavaScript/TypeScript and React is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Proven track record of technical leadership beyond team boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of system design, algorithms, and data structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience with modern backend architectures, APIs, and service-oriented systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Solid background in automated testing strategies (TDD, BDD, integration testing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of PostgreSQL and data modeling is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Understanding of networking fundamentals (TCP/IP , UDP , etc.) is highly valuable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience working in Agile environments with cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Ability to operate in high-trust, high-confidentiality environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are and what we stand for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nozomi Networks is the leader in OT and IoT Cybersecurity. We protect the world&#39;s critical infrastructure, industrial and government organizations from cyber threats by providing exceptional network visibility, threat detection and operational insight. We’re always innovating and we hire the best at what they do to ensure our customers always have access to fast product enhancements, exceptional engineering support and rapid deployment across continents.&amp;nbsp;If you like a challenge, and value integrity and customer success, we invite you to help Nozomi Networks build the future of OT and IoT cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity, Inclusion and Belonging are part of our core beliefs, at Nozomi Networks. Diversity of thought, background and culture broadens our knowledge of the world and helps us learn, grow, and gain new perspectives. What makes us all different is what makes us powerful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of our benefits are customized to the country you are based in, naturally we want to get the best out of our Nozomiers, so we provide the best benefits packages, such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unparalleled Flexible Time-Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Need to know information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Successful candidates will be subjected to background verification checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be cautious of unsolicited messages, fake email addresses, requests for money and unclear job descriptions. Report suspicious activity to authorities. Our open job opportunities and descriptions are posted on Nozomi Networks&#39; career page. If in any doubt please apply for opportunities on our careers website &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nozominetworks.com/company/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you would like to know more about our Privacy Policy, please click &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nozominetworks.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. Any questions about how we process personal information, or if you would like help exercising your privacy rights please contact us using the email provided within the Privacy Policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Engineering  Mendrisio

Senior Sales Engineer, UK &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join the company that’s building the telemetry infrastructure for the AI era. At Cribl, we partner with IT and Security teams at many of the world’s biggest enterprises, including half of the Fortune 100, to bridge the gap between AI ambition and infrastructure reality. As the AI Platform for Telemetry, we give customers the choice, control, and flexibility to manage and analyze telemetry for both humans and agents, so they can build what’s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re one of the fastest‑growing private companies and a leading player in a massive, fast‑moving market. With a global workforce, we’re remote‑first and grounded in a simple idea: software is a people business. Cribl is the place where curious, collaborative people can do their best work, grow fast, and bring their full selves to the herd.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;Location: UK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help CIOs, CISOs, and CTOs see how Cribl can turn complex telemetry, observability, and security challenges into measurable business value whilst earning the confidence of an enterprise architect through your technical depth and consultative approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner directly with Account Executives throughout complex sales cycles, from discovery and solution design through proof of value and close. You’ll design and configure solutions by working with real customer data and demonstrating how Cribl can help customers improve operational and security outcomes. Your work will span the AI Platform for Telemetry, helping customers build a flexible data foundation for observability, security, and AI-driven operations rather than limiting them to a single tool or use case.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As An Active Member Of Our Team, You Will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Executives to own technical strategy from discovery through proof of value to close, defining use cases and measurable success criteria across observability, security, and IT operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver tailored demos, whiteboards, workshops and executive presentations that connect business value to technical capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead proof of value, from configuration to validating and presenting results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address objections, differentiate Cribl and secure the technical win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Customer Success, Services, Support and partners for a smooth implementation handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share customer feedback with Product and Engineering to improve solutions and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If You’ve Got It - We Want It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in vendor Sales Engineering, Solutions Architecture or similar customer-facing roles in enterprise technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and storytelling for technical teams and C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative approach: listen, ask thoughtful questions, build trust and connect recommendations to business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MEDDPICC, Command of the Message, or similar sales methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, self-driven working style, with strong prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in English is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Live in United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 30%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience That Will Help You Stand Out&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Cribl, Splunk, Elastic, Datadog, Dynatrace, Grafana, or Microsoft Sentinel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on telemetry experience with logs, metrics, traces, or events, including data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution design experience, networking and operating system fundamentals and familiarity with AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about AI-assisted troubleshooting, investigations, and telemetry workflows, grounded in practical customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-GV1&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary for this role is dependent on country of employment and will be based on the individual candidate&#39;s job-related knowledge, skills, and experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition to base salary, for sales and some sales-adjacent roles, employees are eligible to earn incentive compensation (commission). For all other roles, employees are eligible to participate in the Cribl Corporate Bonus Program.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, Cribl offers a benefits package that may include retirement/pension support, paid holidays and paid time off, remote office setup support, equity, and other wellness and support programs. Benefits vary by country in accordance with local requirements and market practice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£95,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£127,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring Your Whole Self&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Diversity drives innovation, enables better decisions to support our customers, and inspires change for the better. We’re building a culture where differences are valued and welcomed, and we work together to bring out the best in each other. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, or any other applicable legally protected characteristics in the location in which the candidate is applying.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Interested in joining the Cribl herd? Learn more about the smartest, funniest, most passionate goats you’ll ever meet at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cribl.io/about-us/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;cribl.io/about-us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Sales

Programme Director &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HEX brings together creative talent, emerging technology and industry-leading partners to turn innovation into scalable solutions for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Programme Director to lead the end-to-end delivery of a complex, high-profile programme at the intersection of creative production, AI and emerging technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will translate strategic objectives into an integrated delivery plan, bring multiple workstreams together and ensure the programme delivers against its commitments. You’ll take ownership of programme governance, dependencies, risks and decisions, providing the clarity and control needed to navigate complexity and maintain momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working across senior leadership, technology partners, clients and multidisciplinary delivery teams, you’ll connect the bigger picture with the detail of execution, ensuring everyone is aligned on what needs to happen, when and why.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the programme&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the integrated programme plan, translating objectives into clear workstreams, milestones, deliverables and success measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective governance, clear accountability and a consistent approach to programme reporting and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain oversight of the critical path, dependencies and delivery commitments, ensuring activity across workstreams comes together to achieve the overall programme objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a clear view of programme health, progress and emerging issues, giving leadership the information needed to make timely, informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead delivery across multiple workstreams, aligning teams on priorities, milestones and interdependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate risks, resolve blockers and drive action on issues before they impact delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage changes to scope, timelines and deliverables, assessing their implications and ensuring trade-offs are agreed and understood.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge assumptions, address competing priorities and keep teams focused on the outcomes that matter most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold workstream leads accountable for commitments, following through on actions and intervening where delivery is at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align clients and stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders across WPP, technology partners and client organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create alignment across teams with different priorities, ensuring clear ownership, timely decisions and a shared understanding of programme objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead programme reviews and executive reporting, communicating progress, risks, decisions and required actions with clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central point of coordination for programme delivery, connecting stakeholders and ensuring commitments translate into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver measurable outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain oversight of performance against programme objectives, milestones, budgets and agreed commercial commitments, working with the relevant commercial and finance leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track success measures that demonstrate client adoption, business impact and value delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging delivery or commercial risks, making their implications visible and driving appropriate action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use performance data and programme insight to inform decisions, address underperformance and improve outcomes throughout the programme lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading complex programmes involving multiple workstreams, interdependent deliverables and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of translating strategic objectives into executable plans and delivering against challenging commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programme management expertise across integrated planning, governance, critical path management, risk, dependencies and change control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The judgement to anticipate problems, navigate ambiguity and make effective decisions when priorities or delivery conditions change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The confidence to challenge constructively, influence senior stakeholders and hold teams accountable across matrixed organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial awareness, including an understanding of budgets, forecasts and performance against agreed commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to turn complex information into clear decisions, recommendations and executive-level reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, collaborative approach, combining attention to detail with a clear focus on overall programme objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in creative production, digital transformation, AI-enabled programmes or technology partnerships would be advantageous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, integrated programme plan that connects workstreams, milestones, dependencies and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Predictable, well-controlled delivery, with risks anticipated, blockers resolved and commitments actively managed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear accountability across workstreams and strong alignment between clients, partners and delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timely, informed decision-making supported by transparent reporting and a reliable view of programme performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measurable client outcomes, with clear evidence of adoption, business impact and value delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A programme that meets its objectives while adapting effectively as priorities and requirements evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify not replace human creativity. With access to diverse projects, global career opportunities, and the backing of WPP’s unmatched network, this is a place where you can grow your skills, make real impact, and create work that performs for every audience, across every channel, at every moment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion and Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on legitimate interest as a legal basis for processing personal information under the GDPR for purposes of recruitment and applications for employment. When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button at the bottom of this page, this will send all the information you have added to WPP Production. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarthww.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;st&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarth.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;atement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please contact &lt;a ----- ----- if you need the job advert or form in another format.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
